{"game": "gunfire-reborn", "language": "english", "appid": 1217060, "month": "2026-01", "window": 3, "start_date": 1768521600, "end_date": 1769212799, "month_true_total": 149, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-09-27 01:55:52 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "216633728", "author": {"steamid": "76561197988291024", "personaname": "InvalidBread", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/invalidbread/", "num_games_owned": 731, "num_reviews": 12, "playtime_forever": 4719, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 4696, "last_played": 1778460273, "avatar": "73a4dde630d9394b46cce958e00573d6cd53bd99"}, "language": "english", "review": "I really, REALLY, enjoy this game. They got the effort, they got the looks, they got the maintenance and they got the gumption to just keep going. I really want to play this game more, but with queue times as they are currently, I don't really find it worthwhile to try and sit there and wait.\nHOWEVER, this is a plea to the devs, you're game is dying cause of low player base. The free weekend was a great boon to the game, but very short lived. I would love to see you all reduce price and maybe even a big expansion bundle discount with the game for dirt cheap? Get the copies out there, at 50-75% off, if you can get another thousand or five thousand weekly players, I think you'll see a lot more chatter and discussion of this game.\n\nI really want your game to continue and to succeed, but the player count desperately needs to go up.", "timestamp_created": 1769198896, "timestamp_updated": 1769198896, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1637202540", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "216623183", "author": {"steamid": "76561198075753357", "personaname": "FloverinE